      "title": "Getting Started: Img2Img",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Win Models Img2Img Template\n\nGeneric image-to-image workflow with a checkpoint loader, Multi LoRA Stack, StringReplace prompt templates, image encode, sampler, VAE decode, and save node.\n\nChoose a checkpoint, choose an input image, edit the prompt templates, and tune denoise for the edit strength."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -690,
        610
      ],
      "size": [
        460,
        350
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 2,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "FAQ",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "This template assumes a checkpoint that loads through CheckpointLoaderSimple. It is intended for checkpoint-style SD/SDXL/Pony workflows. Split-loader families such as Flux.2 Klein need separate diffusion model, text encoder, and VAE loader nodes; selecting one in CheckpointLoaderSimple can fail later with an invalid VAE."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
